  "contract": [
    "Spellblade rank 3 (812577) reads 'Your melee attacks have a 12% chance to restore 20% of your base mana.'",
    "The talent is a PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL_WITH_VALUE aura onto 812574 with DBC ProcFlags 0, so without a spell_proc",
    "row Aura::GetProcEffectMask returns 0 and the aura never procs. The spell_proc row gives it melee auto attack",
    "and melee ability flags for every class family. Sixty unarmed 2000 ms swings at 12% leave about 0.05%",
    "odds of never seeing an 812574 energize; before the fix it never fires regardless of sample size."
